    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><strong>水詭Water Weird</strong></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt 124.95pt 0pt 0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-para-margin-right:11.9000gd\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">“在泉眼或池邊喝水前先扔一枚銅幣進去。算是用點小錢保你小命。”</em></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:right;MARGIN:0pt 124.95pt 0pt 0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-para-margin-right:11.9000gd;text-align:right\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">X地下城求生奧妙第2條</em></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">水詭是被約束在一個充滿水的湖泊或者泉眼中的元素生物守護者。在水中的水詭處於隱形狀態。只有在它準備用絞纏攻擊目標的時候纔會表現出明顯的外觀。水詭會攻擊除其召喚者及召喚者限定的非目標對象外其他所有生物。如果被殺死，水詭會變成毫無生氣的一灘水。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>善惡詭物Good and Evil Weirds。</strong></em>和大多數元素生物一樣，水詭對於善惡毫無概念。但被約束到聖潔水體或污穢水體中的水詭也會逐漸被其環境影響，變成中立善良或者中立邪惡。<br />中立善良的水詭會嘗試驅逐敵人而不是將他們殺死。而中立邪惡的水詭則會選擇殺死敵人，甚至會攻擊其召喚者。如果一個邪惡水詭的水被法術<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">淨化飲食purify food and drink spell</em>淨化，則它也將隨之失去邪惡傾向。</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN:left;MARGIN:0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\"><strong>元素本質Elemental Nature。</strong></em>水詭不需要進行呼吸，飲食和睡眠。</p><p>A water weird is an elemental guardian bound to a specific water-filled location, such as a pool or fountain.</p><p>Invisible while immersed in water, its serpentine shape becomes clear only when it emerges to attack, using its coils to crush any creature other than its summoner and those its summoner declares as off limits. When slain, a water weird becomes an inanimate pool of water.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Good and Evil Weirds\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Good and Evil Weirds.</span> Like most elementals, a water weird has no concept of good or evil. However, a water weird bound to a sacred or befouled source of water begins to take on the nature of that site, becoming neutral good or neutral evil.</p><p>A neutral good water weird tries to frighten away interlopers rather than kill them, while a neutral evil water weird kills its victims for pleasure and might turn against its summoner. A water weird loses its evil alignment if its waters are cleansed with a @spell[purify food and drink] spell.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Elemental Nature\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Elemental Nature.</span> A water weird doesn't require air, food, drink, or sleep.</p></div></div><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset rd__b-inset--readaloud\"><div class=\"rd__quote\"><p class=\"rd__quote-line rd__quote-line--last\">“<em>Before you drink from a fountain or pool, toss a copper coin into it. It's a small price to pay for your life.</em>”</p><p><span class=\"rd__quote-by\">— X the Mystic's 2nd rule of dungeon survival</span></p></div></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
