        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">近戰武器攻擊：</em>命中+5，觸及10尺，單一生物。<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">命中：</em>13（3d6+3）點鈍擊傷害。如果目標體型爲中型或更小體型，則目標被擒抱（逃脫DC 13）並向水詭所在方向拉近5尺。直至擒抱終止前，目標被束縛，同時水詭嘗試淹沒目標，而水詭也不能同時絞纏其他目標。</p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+5]]{+5} to hit, reach 10 ft., one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 13 ([[/damage 3d6 + 3 type=bludgeoning]]) damage. If the target is Medium or smaller, it is &amp;Reference[condition=grappled] (escape DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">13</span>) and pulled 5 feet toward the water weird. Until this grapple ends, the target is &amp;Reference[condition=restrained], the water weird tries to drown it, and the water weird can't constrict another target.</p></div>",
